  "bodyHash": "49f5c0e57e627578",
  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3onlleF.png\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong>裝備就位。等級提升。戰力全開。</strong></span> <br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uDdtEDJ.png\"> <br><br></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Forge | NeoForge | Fabric-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.18.2 | 1.19.2 | 1.20.1-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\"> <br><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Architectury_API-required-ecebe6?labelColor=fc7200&style=for-the-badge\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Server_side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Client_side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\"> <br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AKMkECwnqf\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973266096763318303?color=7289DA&label=Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\"> </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong>為所有戰鬥裝備升級</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">透過擊敗怪物與首領來達成！</span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k3clITQ.png\" width=\"75%\"></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong>即使損壞也能修復</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">使用鐵砧與對應素材即可修復！</span><br><br><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FHFsOqk.png\" width=\"75%\"></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong>新增遠程傷害屬性</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">適用於弓、弩與三叉戟等武器</span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bmrz9zC.png\" width=\"75%\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong>自由設定模組內容</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">可使用資料包、設定檔，甚至是 LevelingAPI 進行調整！</span><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ojohhHB.png\" width=\"90%\"><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">官方文件請見 <a href=\"https://github.com/GekidoLukas/weaponleveling/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></span> <br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>您也可以在此生成可升級物品檔案 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgekidolukas.github.io%252flevelable_item.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a> </strong></span></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:xx-large\"><strong>擴充模組</strong></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wl-bc-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:large\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qLE8biJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></span></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wl-ef-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QGS2i32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wl-tetra-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lt0i71O.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong>資訊</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>指令</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">使用 <strong>/itemlevel &lt;set|add&gt; &lt;player&gt; &lt;level|points&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</strong> 變更武器等級</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:large\">使用 <strong>/print_tag_list item &lt;selected|of&gt; (&lt;item&gt;)</strong> 列出物品的所有標籤</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:large\">使用 <strong>/print_tag_list entity &lt;looking|of&gt; (&lt;entity&gt;)</strong> 列出實體的所有標籤</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>模組支援</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:large\">雖然部分模組可能仍可使用，但我們已放棄官方內建支援，改為提供擴充模組。這能讓我們對這些模組及主模組進行更快且更精確的更新。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:large\"><strong>實機展示與評價</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:medium\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fRJ7smpI5F7w%253fsi%253d-yuSrtdNpSUYhknl%2526t%253d143\" rel=\"nofollow\">Noxus 專題介紹 - 已過時</a></span></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong>支援語言</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1fa-1f1f8.png\" width=\"32\"> <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e9-1f1ea.png\" width=\"32\"> <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e8-1f1f3.png\" width=\"32\"> <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1f7-1f1fa.png\" width=\"32\"> <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1fa-1f1e6.png\" width=\"32\"></div>",
